%%label IV. Gigue: Allegro
%%note D major. A fugal gigue in two repeated halves; the second half begins with the subject upside down.
X:1
T:Bach’s Missing Symphony
T:IV. Gigue: Allegro
C:Claude (AI), in the manner of J. S. Bach
M:6/8
L:1/8
Q:"Allegro" 3/8=100
%%score [tpt1 tpt2] timp [ob1 ob2 bn] [v1 v2 va vc cb] hpd
% Original AI-composed homage. The score is written at sounding pitch.
V:tpt1 clef=treble name="Tpt. I"
V:tpt2 clef=treble name="Tpt. II"
V:timp clef=bass name="Timp."
V:ob1 clef=treble name="Ob. I"
V:ob2 clef=treble name="Ob. II"
V:bn clef=bass name="Bn."
V:v1 clef=treble name="Vl. I"
V:v2 clef=treble name="Vl. II"
V:va clef=alto name="Vla."
V:vc clef=bass name="Vc."
V:cb clef=bass name="Cb."
V:hpd clef=treble name="Hpd."
K:D
V:tpt1
